lse,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103583","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103583","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103583.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103583.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-27T14:50:36Z"},"body":"- Close https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/1031\r\n\r\nClose #99366\r\n\r\nThis PR adopts a relatively simple approach, without storing extra intensity field in Color class.\r\n\r\nAdds an intensity slider and limit the max value of RGB to 1 in ColorPicker raw mode. Intensity is inferred from raw RGB and may change after switch color mode. The final color is calculated as `color * pow(2, intensity)`.\r\n\r\nAlso keep the hex LineEdit always visiable and switch it to code if RGB exceeds the valid range.\r\n\r\nEdit: \r\n<img src=https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/22e94cd7-a22d-41ce-8330-09548698cc1f height=350>\r\n\r\nDepends on #102240 to allow greater values.\r\n\r\nEdit: \r\nNow the intensity slider is added to all modes and should work.\r\nI modified the ColorMode and ColorPickerShape so that they only handle colors which the intensity has not been applied.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/user